#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/emails/send-email-verification-link.email.tsx
msgid "Thanks for registering for an account on CRM! Before we get started, we just need to confirm that this is you. Click below to verify your email address."
msgstr "CRM’da hisob qaydnomasidan o‘tganingiz uchun rahmat! Boshlashdan oldin, bu siz ekaningizni tasdiqlashimiz kerak. Elektron pochta manzilingizni tasdiqlash uchun quyidagi tugmani bosing."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/emails/password-reset-link.email.tsx
msgid "This link is only valid for the next {duration}. If the link does not work, you can use the login verification link directly:"
msgstr "Ushbu havola faqat keyingi {duration} davomida amal qiladi. Agar havola ishlamasa, siz tizimga kirish tasdiqlash havolasidan bevosita foydalanishingiz mumkin:"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/emails/send-email-verification-link.email.tsx
msgid "Verify Email"
msgstr "Elektron pochtani tasdiqlang"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/emails/send-email-verification-link.email.tsx
msgid "We received a request to change the email address associated with your CRM account. Click below to confirm this change."
msgstr "CRM hisob qaydnomangiz bilan bog‘langan elektron pochta manzilini o‘zgartirish so‘rovini oldik. Ushbu o‘zgarishni tasdiqlash uchun quyidagi tugmani bosing."

